{"last_link_id": 11, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["先调亮度 / 对比度，再调饱和度：先把画面明暗定好，再调整色彩鲜艳度，不容易出现死白 / 死黑。\n避免拉满：对比度超过 1.2、饱和度超过 1.6 容易出现色彩断层和过曝。\n配合蒙版使用：给节点加蒙版，只对部分区域调色（比如只提亮瓶身，背景不变）。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "Note", "title": "豆包提供", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [495.5823059082031, 110.79747772216797], "pos": [620.6771850585938, 635.31591796875], "id": 8, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["brightness（亮度）\n默认值：1.00\n作用：控制整张图的整体明暗\n1.00：不调整，保持原图亮度\n大于 1：画面整体变亮（高光、暗部同时提亮）\n小于 1：画面整体变暗\n\ncontrast（对比度）\n默认值：1.00\n作用：控制亮部和暗部的差距\n1.00：不调整，保持原图对比度\n大于 1：对比度提升（亮部更亮，暗部更暗，画面更通透）\n小于 1：对比度降低（画面变灰，细节柔和）\n\nsaturation（饱和度）\n默认值：1.00\n作用：控制色彩的鲜艳程度\n1.00：不调整，保持原图饱和度\n大于 1：色彩更鲜艳（你当前 1.50，色彩会比原图更浓艳）\n小于 1：色彩变淡，0 为黑白"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [521.4993896484375, 385.51849365234375], "pos": [45.76792526245117, 633.8292846679688], "id": 7, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 3, "name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "dir": 4, "type": "STRING"}], "size": [380.411865234375, 280.1719970703125], "pos": [822.2197875976562, 279.369140625], "widgets_values": [[{"name": "A", "selected": true, "url": "/view?filename=rgthree.compare._temp_argvu_00015_xmupg_1775094965.jpg&type=temp&subfolder=&rand=0.9078851986425347&Rh-Comfy-Auth=eyJ1c2VySWQiOiIxZTg5YTU5ZTJjYzQ3MWIxZGZkOGQ2YjA5ZTM1OTliNCIsInNpZ25FeHBpcmUiOjE3NzU2OTk0ODE0MzMsInRzIjoxNzc1MDk0NjgxNDMzLCJzaWduIjoiMGRhMWNiZTAxMjdjYTE5Y2I0ZWE2N2UwN2RjMjdiNTgifQ==&Rh-Identify=1e89a59e2cc471b1dfd8d6b09e3599b4"}, {"name": "B", "selected": true, "url": "/view?filename=rgthree.compare._temp_argvu_00016_puuyv_1775094966.jpg&type=temp&subfolder=&rand=0.41345614448743706&Rh-Comfy-Auth=eyJ1c2VySWQiOiIxZTg5YTU5ZTJjYzQ3MWIxZGZkOGQ2YjA5ZTM1OTliNCIsInNpZ25FeHBpcmUiOjE3NzU2OTk0ODE0MzMsInRzIjoxNzc1M